  "scenario_text": "# Experiment F - placement (RQ3 / H4).\n# Fixed link matrix: gateway->inventory environment 50 ms, gateway->pricing environment 80 ms\n# (pricing is the slower, critical dependency in parallel mode). Placement changes RELABEL which\n# environment an instance is in (the container does not move; the injected delay changes):\n#   distributed       inventory-a: aws-simulated, pricing: azure-simulated   (critical path ~80 ms)\n#   pricing-local     pricing moved to the gateway's environment             (critical path ~50 ms)\n#   inventory-local   inventory-a moved to the gateway's environment         (critical path ~80 ms)\n#   both-local        both moved                                              (critical path ~0 ms)\nid: F_placement\ntitle: \"F - Placement of pricing and inventory relative to the gateway\"\nhypotheses: [H4]\nrequires_mode: simulated\nworkload: {rate_rps: 20, arrival: poisson, warmup_s: 5, duration_s: 30}\nruns: 3\nseed: 606\ndefaults:\n  call_mode: parallel\n  links:\n    local--aws-simulated: 50\n    local--gcp-simulated: 50\n    local--azure-simulated: 80\n    aws-simulated--azure-simulated: 0\n    aws-simulated--gcp-simulated: 0\n    azure-simulated--gcp-simulated: 0\nconditions:\n  - {name: distributed}\n  - {name: pricing-local, instance_env: {pricing: local}}\n  - {name: inventory-local, instance_env: {inventory-a: local}}\n  - {name: both-local, instance_env: {pricing: local, inventory-a: local}}\n",
